[36m(main_task pid=3800193)[0m  IDisposable.Dispose() was called on an EntityCommand instance that was still associated with the context. This is not permitted, and can lead to concurrency and/or data corruption issues. To fix this issue please first remove the object from the context, and ensure the context has been disposed before calling Dispose() on an associated EntityCommand.
